## Installation

### HACS (custom repository)

1. In HACS, open the menu and choose "Custom repositories".
2. Add `https://github.com/{{ github_owner }}/{{ repo_name }}` with the category "Integration".
3. Install {{ integration_name }}, then restart Home Assistant.

### Manual

Copy the `custom_components/{{ integration_domain }}` folder of the latest release into the `custom_components` folder of your Home Assistant configuration, then restart Home Assistant.

